the most important tree

00:31:26.879 --> 00:31:30.306
is no less than Sheytan (Satan) himself.

00:31:30.720 --> 00:31:34.160
Satan makes us forget.

00:31:34.880 --> 00:31:36.200
And thus we can conclude

00:31:36.200 --> 00:31:38.833
on the basis of these verses

00:31:38.833 --> 00:31:41.066
that I have elaborated,

00:31:41.066 --> 00:31:44.499
because Sheytan (Satan) who made

00:31:44.499 --> 00:31:48.793
poor Adam, our great-great-grandfather, forget.

00:31:51.660 --> 00:31:54.740
I think there's not much speculation to the point.

00:31:55.420 --> 00:31:59.980
However, the fact that Adam forgot,

00:31:59.980 --> 00:32:03.038
even temporarily,

00:32:03.038 --> 00:32:04.851
leads us to assume

00:32:04.851 --> 00:32:07.633
that he has forgotten something that he knew.

00:32:07.633 --> 00:32:10.560
You cannot forget something that you never knew,

00:32:10.560 --> 00:32:11.746
or you never know.

00:32:13.560 --> 00:32:16.060
And thus we had some speculation last time,

00:32:16.060 --> 00:32:19.259
and I submitted to you, brothers and sisters,

00:32:19.259 --> 00:32:23.560
that what Adam forgot

00:32:23.560 --> 00:32:28.886
was what Allah Himself Subhanahu Wa Ta'ala taught him.

00:32:29.234 --> 00:32:33.887
And as you know, in Sura 2, verse 31,

00:32:33.887 --> 00:32:35.001
it's very clear.

00:32:35.607 --> 00:32:40.912
Allah taught Adam all the names.

00:32:43.057 --> 00:32:48.560
I admit there was some Tafsir or commentary on this point.

00:32:49.119 --> 00:32:52.980
I went further and said that these names

00:32:52.980 --> 00:32:56.886
which Allah taught Adam

00:32:56.886 --> 00:33:01.772
have to do with Allah Himself,

00:33:01.772 --> 00:33:06.586
who Allah is, what Allah is,

00:33:06.586 --> 00:33:10.119
His powers, more important,

00:33:10.119 --> 00:33:13.560
that He is the source of all power.

00:33:16.073 --> 00:33:21.798
And knowing these qualities of Allah,

00:33:21.798 --> 00:33:23.933
denoted by His names,

00:33:23.933 --> 00:33:28.560
gives us a profound, a deep form of knowledge.

00:33:29.259 --> 00:33:35.213
It makes us understand the signs, the Ayas around us.

00:33:35.213 --> 00:33:37.840
And not only the signs around us,

00:33:37.840 --> 00:33:39.865
but the signs within us.

00:33:39.865 --> 00:33:44.560
Quran speaks of the signs outside us,

00:33:44.560 --> 00:33:47.975
without and within.

00:33:49.420 --> 00:33:51.560
And if we know Allah's manifestations

00:33:51.560 --> 00:33:54.886
without and within us,

00:33:54.886 --> 00:33:58.560
a high form of knowledge, I'm insisting,

00:33:58.560 --> 00:34:01.560
we will be able to see all phenomena

00:34:01.560 --> 00:34:04.189
in its, the blue light,

00:34:04.189 --> 00:34:08.566
natural phenomena, both physical and biological,

00:34:08.566 --> 00:34:12.560
and within ourselves, psychological phenomena,

00:34:12.560 --> 00:34:18.560
and what these, and what these psychological phenomena brings about,

00:34:18.560 --> 00:34:21.560
individual and social phenomena.

00:34:21.560 --> 00:34:23.560
And as I mentioned last time,

00:34:23.560 --> 00:34:25.083
all of these things,

00:34:25.083 --> 00:34:31.560
our birth, our childhood, our youth,

00:34:31.560 --> 00:34:37.308
our death, our loss, our petty hatreds,

00:34:37.308 --> 00:34:42.560
our resentment, emotions, tribulations,

00:34:42.560 --> 00:34:44.030
all of these things,

00:34:44.030 --> 00:34:46.560
even warfare between groups and so on,

00:34:46.560 --> 00:34:50.825
all of these represent manifestations

00:34:50.825 --> 00:34:52.554
of Allah's creative power.

00:34:53.295 --> 00:34:54.560
He is the Ruler.

00:34:54.560 --> 00:34:56.560
He rules everything.

00:34:56.560 --> 00:34:59.560
And nothing can happen without His will.

00:35:03.586 --> 00:35:08.355
Then, we talked also of Allah breathing

00:35:08.355 --> 00:35:13.090
something of His Spirit into Adam.

00:35:13.090 --> 00:35:14.507
It's very interesting.

00:35:14.507 --> 00:35:17.089
On at least 3 points, Quran says

00:35:17.089 --> 00:35:20.000
that Allah breathes into Adam

00:35:20.000 --> 00:35:22.560
something

00:35:22.560 --> 00:35:24.560
MIN (مِن) the Arabic word is

00:35:24.560 --> 00:35:26.077
(32:9) مِن رُّوحِهِ

00:35:26.077 --> 00:35:28.090
[32:9]  ... from His spirit. ...

00:35:28.560 --> 00:35:30.000
But it's very important.

00:35:30.000 --> 00:35:32.136
He did not say He blew His Spirit.

00:35:33.143 --> 00:35:35.143
Because then,

00:35:35.143 --> 00:35:37.302
Allah will be creating other Allahs,

00:35:37.302 --> 00:35:38.700
which is a contradiction.

00:35:42.196 --> 00:35:43.243
Something.

00:35:43.719 --> 00:35:45.288
What does this mean?

00:35:47.143 --> 00:35:48.560
Where we have this?

00:35:48.560 --> 00:35:51.984
In Sura 15, verse 29.

00:35:51.984 --> 00:35:54.984
In Sura 32, verse 9.

00:35:55.355 --> 00:35:57.931
And in Sura 38, verse 72.

00:35:59.202 --> 00:36:01.831
And this is what I believe, it's up

00:36:01.831 --> 00:36:04.090
to you to reflect on what I'm saying,

00:36:04.090 --> 00:36:06.560
to accept or reject my views,

00:36:06.560 --> 00:36:10.000
or to use my views as a point of departure

00:36:10.000 --> 00:36:12.560
for you to go deeper into it,

00:36:12.560 --> 00:36:16.560
or find an alternative interpretation.

00:36:18.361 --> 00:36:21.090
My interpretation is that

00:36:21.090 --> 00:36:24.196
the breathing into Adam

00:36:24.196 --> 00:36:25.825
something of His Spirit,

00:36:25.825 --> 00:36:27.560
Allah's Spirit,

00:36:27.560 --> 00:36:29.030
would be the following.

00:36:29.560 --> 00:36:31.560
First,

00:36:31.560 --> 00:36:34.560
the capacity,

00:36:34.560 --> 00:36:39.083
the capacity to know,

00:36:39.083 --> 00:36:43.024
to know the names themselves.

00:36:44.030 --> 00:36:47.566
For if man does not have the capacity to know the names,

00:36:47.566 --> 00:36:49.030
he cannot know.

00:36:49.560 --> 00:36:51.189
This is very clear.

00:36:51.189 --> 00:36:53.189
Let's say, A equals A.

00:36:53.560 --> 00:36:56.149
In other words, Allah had given him

00:36:56.149 --> 00:36:59.149
the capacity for knowledge,

00:36:59.149 --> 00:37:01.149
any special knowledge,

00:37:01.149 --> 00:37:04.666
knowledge to know about Allah Himself.

00:37:06.878 --> 00:37:10.878
Allah is so great,

00:37:10.878 --> 00:37:13.931
nothing can know Allah

00:37:13.931 --> 00:37:17.037
unless something who knows Allah

00:37:17.037 --> 00:37:20.000
has something given to him by Allah.

00:37:20.000 --> 00:37:22.878
I hope this is very clear.

00:37:22.878 --> 00:37:25.566
So, this is philosophical proof.

00:37:27.560 --> 00:37:29.295
You cannot know Allah

00:37:29.295 --> 00:37:33.560
unless Allah Himself has given you the power to know Him.

00:37:33.560 --> 00:37:35.136
Because He is so great

00:37:35.136 --> 00:37:37.136
and so above us,

00:37:37.136 --> 00:37:39.560
no one less than Allah can know Him.

00:37:39.560 --> 00:37:41.560
But Allah gave man

00:37:41.560 --> 00:37:43.560
His part of His breath.

00:37:43.825 --> 00:37:46.189
And this breath of Allah in us

00:37:46.189 --> 00:37:49.778
is what allows us to know Allah. Alright?

00:37:49.778 --> 00:37:52.560
Now, this is a very profound view.

00:37:52.560 --> 00:37:53.984
I hope you will not

00:37:53.984 --> 00:37:55.289
forget it.

00:37:57.143 --> 00:37:58.878
But more than that,

00:37:58.878 --> 00:38:00.825
it's not just a matter of giving man

00:38:00.825 --> 00:38:02.712
the power to know Him.

00:38:03.560 --> 00:38:05.189
Allah, I believe,

00:38:05.189 --> 00:38:07.189
had given us

00:38:07.189 --> 00:38:09.189
certain capacities

00:38:09.189 --> 00:38:11.189
to manifest

00:38:11.189 --> 00:38:12.825
some of the qualities

00:38:12.825 --> 00:38:14.560
which we attribute to Him.

00:38:15.090 --> 00:38:17.297
And the Quran is full of these attributes.

00:38:18.090 --> 00:38:19.560
When the Quran says that

00:38:19.560 --> 00:38:23.073
Allah destroys,

00:38:23.073 --> 00:38:24.840
we all know we can destroy.

00:38:24.840 --> 00:38:26.001
Can we destroy?

00:38:26.793 --> 00:38:29.052
Why are we destroying things day after day?

00:38:31.119 --> 00:38:34.030
And so,

00:38:34.030 --> 00:38:35.793
we have no capacities.

00:38:38.560 --> 00:38:41.560
This, I think, is a second,

00:38:41.560 --> 00:38:43.560
but just as important meaning

00:38:43.560 --> 00:38:45.306
of

00:38:45.306 --> 00:38:46.560
the breath of Allah

00:38:46.560 --> 00:38:47.560
in us.

00:38:50.306 --> 00:38:53.285
And it's not that we just have these capacities.

00:38:54.560 --> 00:38:57.565
Because the capacity can remain a capacity.

00:38:58.840 --> 00:39:00.840
There must be certain actualities

00:39:00.840 --> 00:39:03.060
in the relations between Allah

00:39:03.060 --> 00:39:05.086
and mankind such that

00:39:05.086 --> 00:39:08.353
these qualities can become

00:39:08.353 --> 00:39:10.560
what we would call actual.

00:39:10.560 --> 00:39:12.234
In other words,

00:39:12.234 --> 00:39:14.259
we may have

00:39:14.259 --> 00:39:15.933
the capacity

00:39:15.933 --> 00:39:18.560
to feel pity or to love,

00:39:18.560 --> 00:39:20.560
but that capacity can always,

00:39:20.560 --> 00:39:22.001
will always remain a capacity.

00:39:22.280 --> 00:39:23.560
Unless there is something

00:39:23.560 --> 00:39:26.192
that will actualize that capacity

00:39:26.192 --> 00:39:27.612
into something

00:39:27.612 --> 00:39:29.560
that is real.

00:39:29.560 --> 00:39:30.560
So,

00:39:30.560 --> 00:39:32.560
if, if we have the capacity

00:39:32.560 --> 00:39:33.560
for mercy,

00:39:33.560 --> 00:39:34.560
that capacity

00:39:34.560 --> 00:39:35.560
will remain a capacity.

00:39:35.840 --> 00:39:37.840
It can only be actualized

00:39:37.840 --> 00:39:40.187
on account of certain forces.

00:39:40.687 --> 00:39:43.060
Allah Himself can help us,

00:39:43.060 --> 00:39:45.365
or His Messengers can teach us

00:39:45.365 --> 00:39:46.924
how to actualize

00:39:46.924 --> 00:39:48.047
this capacity.

00:39:49.933 --> 00:39:51.933
Incidentally, this point shows

00:39:51.933 --> 00:39:54.488
the necessity of revelation.

00:39:56.026 --> 00:39:58.937
So, I think we have said so much about these powers

00:39:58.937 --> 00:40:00.000
to know,

00:40:00.000 --> 00:40:01.560
these powers to be created,

00:40:01.560 --> 00:40:03.933
these powers to destroy,

00:40:03.933 --> 00:40:04.933
these powers

00:40:04.933 --> 00:40:07.119
to have pity,

00:40:07.119 --> 00:40:08.560
and to sympathize,

00:40:08.560 --> 00:40:09.746
the ability

00:40:09.746 --> 00:40:10.933
to have what we call

00:40:10.933 --> 00:40:13.301
this fine sense of consideration.

00:40:15.000 --> 00:40:16.560
And again,

00:40:16.560 --> 00:40:17.746
let me say that

00:40:17.746 --> 00:40:19.560
this breath from Allah

00:40:19.560 --> 00:40:21.094
in mankind

00:40:21.094 --> 00:40:22.374
represents

00:40:22.374 --> 00:40:24.373
the most important parts

00:40:24.373 --> 00:40:26.581
of man's complex nature.

00:40:27.140 --> 00:40:30.140
Man is composed of clay,

00:40:30.140 --> 00:40:33.140
but he also has life in him.

00:40:33.140 --> 00:40:34.814
We attribute that to the soul.

00:40:35.234 --> 00:40:36.560
But we also say,

00:40:36.560 --> 00:40:38.047
based on the Quran,

00:40:38.047 --> 00:40:40.793
that he partakes of the breath

00:40:40.793 --> 00:40:42.814
for the Spirit of Allah.

00:40:43.280 --> 00:40:45.280
This spirit in mankind

00:40:45.280 --> 00:40:47.280
is the highest part,

00:40:47.280 --> 00:40:49.119
the most excellent part,

00:40:49.119 --> 00:40:51.001
of man's soul or not.

00:40:51.560 --> 00:40:53.560
It cannot be otherwise,

00:40:53.560 --> 00:40:57.560
for it comes from Allah Itself.

00:40:57.560 --> 00:40:59.560
It does not belong to us,

00:40:59.560 --> 00:41:01.814
although we are utilizing it.

00:41:03.353 --> 00:41:06.705
And now we can understand deeper some of these verses in the Quran.

00:41:07.187 --> 00:41:08.933
When Adam and Eve

00:41:08.933 --> 00:41:10.119
say to Allah,

00:41:10.119 --> 00:41:11.119
Allah,

00:41:11.119 --> 00:41:13.234
we have wronged ourselves.

00:41:13.560 --> 00:41:15.560
We have wronged ourselves.

00:41:15.560 --> 00:41:16.348
What is the wrong?

00:41:18.306 --> 00:41:20.518
Their feet, stomach, hair, and so on?

00:41:20.954 --> 00:41:22.255
No, it's (unintelligible)

00:41:24.073 --> 00:41:26.073
They realized that they had wronged

00:41:26.073 --> 00:41:29.259
the most important part of themselves.

00:41:29.259 --> 00:41:32.119
That's part which belongs to Allah.

00:41:32.445 --> 00:41:39.150
And in trying to harm that part of Allah, actually, they ended up hurting themselves

00:41:39.150 --> 00:41:41.280
because no one can harm Allah.

00:41:42.560 --> 00:41:43.560
So, if you're angry,

00:41:43.560 --> 00:41:46.340
and you insult Allah, you're not harming Allah.

00:41:46.340 --> 00:41:48.612
You are harming yourself.

00:41:49.560 --> 00:41:50.560
So,

00:41:50.560 --> 00:41:51.746
when you harm

00:41:51.746 --> 00:41:54.259
or negate

00:41:54.259 --> 00:41:57.560
this spirit that Allah had planted into us,

00:41:57.560 --> 00:41:58.560
in the long run,

00:41:58.560 --> 00:41:59.560
you are harming

00:41:59.560 --> 00:42:00.560
or we are harming

00:42:00.560 --> 00:42:01.581
ourselves.

00:42:02.560 --> 00:42:03.840
The breath of Allah

00:42:03.840 --> 00:42:05.280
in Adam and Eve,

00:42:05.280 --> 00:42:06.560
as well as the knowledge

00:42:06.560 --> 00:42:08.560
taught by Allah to them,

00:42:08.560 --> 00:42:09.933
were not given

00:42:09.933 --> 00:42:11.560
their proper due.

00:42:11.980 --> 00:42:14.654
But it was the recognition of this,

00:42:14.654 --> 00:42:17.192
of this mistake,

00:42:17.192 --> 00:42:18.933
that made Adam repent.

00:42:19.446 --> 00:42:21.726
And as we all know,

00:42:21.726 --> 00:42:23.679
is Allah the All-Merciful,

00:42:23.679 --> 00:42:25.819
and in response

00:42:25.819 --> 00:42:27.399
to this repentance,

00:42:27.399 --> 00:42:29.679
Allah presented towards Adam,

00:42:29.679 --> 00:42:32.399
gave words of revelation to him,

00:42:32.399 --> 00:42:34.492
and more important for us now,

00:42:34.492 --> 00:42:37.865
He promised mankind revelation

00:42:37.865 --> 00:42:39.980
for the sending of a guidance.

00:42:40.726 --> 00:42:41.980
In brief,

00:42:41.980 --> 00:42:46.031
what Allah promised Adam and his descendants, the mankind,

00:42:46.031 --> 00:42:49.616
all of us, are reminders.

00:42:50.107 --> 00:42:51.819
And what are these reminders?

00:42:51.819 --> 00:42:52.832
By definition,

00:42:52.832 --> 00:42:54.264
a reminder is something

00:42:54.264 --> 00:42:56.955
to come to act in forgetfulness.

00:42:57.315 --> 00:43:02.648
Because man was created weak, that is, he was not created as a god.

00:43:02.648 --> 00:43:04.873
And therefore, he forgets.

00:43:05.136 --> 00:43:08.806
But Allah's most necessary mechanisms,

00:43:08.806 --> 00:43:10.052
there are as follows:

00:43:10.052 --> 00:43:11.438
descending of prophets.

00:43:11.728 --> 00:43:13.487
These are forms of reminders.

00:43:14.373 --> 00:43:16.839
They are what you call, remembrancers.

00:43:16.839 --> 00:43:20.323
The prophet Muhammad is called a remembrancer.

00:43:21.139 --> 00:43:24.716
Revelations are veritable reminders.

00:43:25.296 --> 00:43:27.661
The Quran is the perfect reminder.

00:43:28.382 --> 00:43:32.332
And Salat is a technique not to forget,

00:43:32.332 --> 00:43:33.438
which means the same.

00:43:33.438 --> 00:43:39.565
I say that Salat Prayer is a technique to keep on reminding us.

00:43:39.565 --> 00:43:43.515
And you will find in Sura 20, verse 14,

00:43:43.515 --> 00:43:47.986
in Sura 76, verses 25-26.

00:43:48.219 --> 00:43:50.965
Thus, Shaytan (Satan)

00:43:50.965 --> 00:43:54.029
as the source of forgetfulness

00:43:54.029 --> 00:43:57.653
is an enemy of prophets.

00:43:57.983 --> 00:44:00.301
Shaytan (Satan) is an enemy of revelation.

00:44:00.555 --> 00:44:03.153
Shaytan (Satan) is an enemy of the Quran.

00:44:03.153 --> 00:44:07.616
And Shaytan (Satan) is the greatest enemy of Salat.

00:44:08.710 --> 00:44:13.499
One of his main jobs on earth is precisely

00:44:13.499 --> 00:44:17.309
to make man forget all of these things that

00:44:17.309 --> 00:44:19.348
we have just mentioned.

00:44:20.020 --> 00:44:23.271
But now,

00:44:23.271 --> 00:44:25.776
getting tired of talking about Shaytan (Satan),

00:44:25.776 --> 00:44:28.187
let's go back to

00:44:28.187 --> 00:44:29.666
the breath of Allah.

00:44:30.547 --> 00:44:34.590
Let's relate the breath of Allah and His teaching of the names to Adam

00:44:34.590 --> 00:44:35.963
to the purpose

00:44:35.963 --> 00:44:37.429
of man's creation.

00:44:38.814 --> 00:44:43.060
Quran says, in Sura 6, verse 102,

00:44:43.060 --> 00:44:45.971
in Sura 20, verse 14,

00:44:45.971 --> 00:44:49.116
in Sura 51, verse 56, and so on

00:44:49.948 --> 00:44:51.847
It's very clear

00:44:51.847 --> 00:44:54.585
that Allah created man

00:44:54.585 --> 00:44:56.157
to worship

00:44:56.157 --> 00:44:57.729
or serve Him.

00:44:58.729 --> 00:45:03.285
The word here, Arabic word, the verb is

00:45:03.285 --> 00:45:04.899
Abada (عبد),

00:45:04.899 --> 00:45:05.819
to serve.

00:45:07.423 --> 00:45:10.534
This reveals immediately to us

00:45:10.534 --> 00:45:13.179
that creation is purposive.

00:45:13.597 --> 00:45:15.216
And one of the meanings of Haq (حق)

00:45:15.216 --> 00:45:17.301
when Allah is called Al-Haq (الحق)

00:45:17.301 --> 00:45:20.831
is that He creates with a purpose.

00:45:21.547 --> 00:45:24.189
And since Allah creates with a purpose,

00:45:24.189 --> 00:45:25.189
certainly,

00:45:25.189 --> 00:45:28.414
He must in some way or another reveal to man

00:45:28.414 --> 00:45:30.473
the nature of this purpose.

00:45:30.473 --> 00:45:31.473
Either

00:45:31.473 --> 00:45:33.691
by putting in man's nature

00:45:33.691 --> 00:45:37.869
a kind of primeval knowledge or by revelation.

00:45:38.770 --> 00:45:40.770
For example,

00:45:40.770 --> 00:45:43.935
if you get, you want to be a house,

00:45:43.935 --> 00:45:46.888
well, you get a carpenter and you'll bring him to the land.

00:45:46.888 --> 00:45:48.358
Well, it's just the same.

00:45:50.358 --> 00:45:51.775
What will do?

00:45:51.775 --> 00:45:56.212
What's it going to be? A brick house, a wooden house

00:45:56.212 --> 00:45:58.212
or a house made (unintelligible) or no.

00:45:59.113 --> 00:46:02.808
You have to tell and that is if you are, if you are rational,

00:46:02.808 --> 00:46:06.556
and if you are in a purposive manner, you have to tell someone,

00:46:06.556 --> 00:46:08.534
that carpenter what he's supposed to know.

00:46:08.534 --> 00:46:10.534
You just (unintelligible). 

00:46:11.223 --> 00:46:12.322
Same thing with Allah.

00:46:12.322 --> 00:46:13.223
We have (unintelligible)

00:46:13.223 --> 00:46:19.659
Since He asked you the purpose, that He already put His mechanism in our nature.

00:46:20.000 --> 00:46:27.536
If that is the case, which is the case, it is part of man's nature already to recognize Allah.

00:46:27.536 --> 00:46:33.825
But more than that, Allah gives us revelation. If He doesn't give us the knowledge,

00:46:33.825 --> 00:46:43.778
at least the propensity to accept such knowledge, when prophets appear. And thus, again, I submit to you all

00:46:43.778 --> 00:46:50.000
that in giving man part of His breath, and in instilling in him the capacity

00:46:50.000 --> 00:46:56.189
or potentialities to actualize certain qualities, now this is very important,

00:46:56.189 --> 00:47:04.355
Allah makes it a duty for man to understand the names and to make such potentialities operative

00:47:04.355 --> 00:47:11.295
or functional in the individual and social life. Now, this is a very strong statement.

00:47:11.295 --> 00:47:19.301
That is, I repeat, if God has given you the capacity to be compassionate,

00:47:19.301 --> 00:47:28.632
and if God has given us the capacity to become patient, ergo, it follows, it is a duty for us to be compassionate and to be patient.

00:47:29.658 --> 00:47:33.560
Now, this is a very strong stance. I don't know what ethical philosophers say about this.

00:47:34.037 --> 00:47:38.984
But if it's part of man's nature, because he has the breath of Allah, and Allah is compassionate,

00:47:38.984 --> 00:47:44.355
when He breathed unto us, He gave us the capacity to be compassionate. Therefore, it's a duty for us

00:47:44.355 --> 00:47:50.000
to develop our capacity for compassion, and certainly for knowledge. Allah is the Knower.

00:47:51.006 --> 00:47:56.070
And if Allah has given us the power to know, it becomes our duty to know.

00:47:57.554 --> 00:48:03.355
Therefore, again, it is part of worship, or part of service to Allah

00:48:03.355 --> 00:48:10.990
to know what Allah is, who He is, what He is, what He represents, and to know more why He created us.

00:48:11.943 --> 00:48:18.196
But more than that, as I mentioned earlier, it is part of Ibada (عباده),

00:48:18.196 --> 00:48:24.335
of worship, to develop those capacities which Allah has given us.

00:48:24.918 --> 00:48:32.143
But, as we discussed in the last Khutba, (unintelligible), and mankind for that matter

00:48:32.143 --> 00:48:38.772
use such capacities in a manner showing lack of restraint. We forget.

00:48:39.242 --> 00:48:45.674
In brief, powers, capacities can be misused or abused.

00:48:48.640 --> 00:48:52.144
Therefore, I'll give you an example.

00:48:52.144 --> 00:48:57.375
The capacity for patience sometimes can be used as a trick for revenge.

00:48:59.136 --> 00:49:00.606
But that's not what Allah wants us.

00:49:01.189 --> 00:49:10.354
Compassion also can be used as a technique to deceive people. Therefore, it's not real compassion.

00:49:12.037 --> 00:49:19.295
Therefore, it now becomes clear to all of us why instructions must come from Allah Himself

00:49:19.295 --> 00:49:24.858
regarding the use of such powers, the ends of such powers.

00:49:24.858 --> 00:49:28.917
This is one of the fundamental meanings of revelation.

00:49:30.000 --> 00:49:33.099
And if man has no free will, there will be no problem.

00:49:33.099 --> 00:49:38.622
If man has no free will, he will be just acting A following B, following C, following D. But no.

00:49:38.622 --> 00:49:41.967
Man has alternatives by the nature of his free will.

00:49:42.550 --> 00:49:44.603
And it is this will

00:49:44.603 --> 00:49:52.020
that can strengthen his potentialities or actualize his potentialities towards selfish or wrong ends.

00:49:52.020 --> 00:49:57.781
Therefore, it is important for us to have revelation.

00:49:57.781 --> 00:50:05.635
And he or she who looks to Allah as the source of revelation will have Allah responding to such person.

00:50:05.635 --> 00:50:09.302
And Allah will give the correct guidance.

00:50:21.009 --> 00:50:27.355
The position of Allah's breath in man is a test.

00:50:28.136 --> 00:50:35.659
It is a test, as I've been repeating and over repeating, on how we should

00:50:35.659 --> 00:50:40.970
develop our potentialities and have them directed properly.

00:50:41.977 --> 00:50:50.977
And Allah has given us the document, how to actualize this potentialities and lead it

00:50:50.977 --> 00:50:54.189
towards the destiny that He has created for us.

00:50:56.037 --> 00:51:01.448
The more we develop our potentialities for the good, that is,

00:51:01.448 --> 00:51:09.560
the more we develop our potentialities in accordance with Allah's guidance, the more our spirit grows,

00:51:09.560 --> 00:51:16.090
which is the same as saying, the more of Allah's breath in us is working. All right?

00:51:16.090 --> 00:51:23.032
I think this is our tautology. It's like saying A is equal to A, or one plus one is equal to two.

00:51:23.628 --> 00:51:28.628
The more we develop our potentialities which Allah gave us for the good,

00:51:28.628 --> 00:51:34.933
that is, the more we are listening or remembering Allah, the more is our spirit growing.

00:51:34.933 --> 00:51:39.560
And since the spirit is the highest form of our soul, the more is our soul growing.

00:51:39.560 --> 00:51:43.886
Now, Ustaz (teacher) has been emphasizing about the growth of our soul.

00:51:43.886 --> 00:51:48.026
I'm sure he has his own profound meaning of what's meant by our soul growth.

00:51:48.026 --> 00:51:54.819
I'm only giving one meaning, one possible meaning of what it means to say that the soul grows.

00:51:54.819 --> 00:52:00.560
To me, the soul growth means that this highest proportion that comes from Allah, the spirit,

00:52:00.560 --> 00:52:02.560
is growing or actualized.

00:52:02.886 --> 00:52:11.844
So, to put it politically, the more of Allah's spirit you have in you, the more of divine elements you have in you.

00:52:12.840 --> 00:52:20.560
The more we remember Allah and do what this remembrance and takes in action, the more

00:52:20.560 --> 00:52:21.840
that the soul grows.

00:52:21.840 --> 00:52:22.560
Right?

00:52:22.560 --> 00:52:25.928
Because the more of Allah's spirit is in us.

00:52:27.980 --> 00:52:30.374
Therefore, the more spiritual we become.

00:52:30.560 --> 00:52:35.233
So, to say in Islam, so-and-so is spiritual has a particular meaning,

00:52:35.233 --> 00:52:40.560
let us not confuse it with what other people, you know, say about so-and-so is spiritual.

00:52:40.560 --> 00:52:43.068
We see that with these transcendental,

00:52:43.068 --> 00:52:47.560
what do you call, people who follow transcendental meditation, "oh, this is very spiritual."

00:52:48.060 --> 00:52:52.560
Well, I'm not the one who's going to fight with these people about the use of the word spiritual.

00:52:52.560 --> 00:52:54.560
They have their own meaning, what spiritual means.

00:52:55.119 --> 00:52:59.653
The Jews and the Christians, I assume, have also the meaning of spirituality.

00:53:00.119 --> 00:53:06.026
But in terms of the Quran, we have a meaning for what is spiritual.

00:53:06.026 --> 00:53:08.560
To us, spiritual will mean what?

00:53:09.026 --> 00:53:11.187
The more of Allah's spirit in us.

00:53:11.513 --> 00:53:12.700
And what does this mean?

00:53:13.026 --> 00:53:14.026
Very clear.

00:53:14.026 --> 00:53:18.462
The more we remember Allah, understand His names,

00:53:18.462 --> 00:53:22.907
understand the manifestation of His names in nature, without and within us.

00:53:23.234 --> 00:53:30.560
And therefore, we can conclude easily, the less we remember Allah, the more our soul will shrink.

00:53:30.560 --> 00:53:33.462
That is the less of His spirit will be (unintelligible), right?

00:53:35.886 --> 00:53:44.560
And off to put it another way. The less we remember Allah, the more His breath in us is stifled.

00:53:44.560 --> 00:53:47.462
We are not allowing it to, to actualize.

00:53:49.793 --> 00:53:57.047
And thus, we can now give a deeper meaning to the word righteousness or Taqwa (تقوا).

00:53:57.047 --> 00:53:58.373
It is this.

00:53:58.560 --> 00:54:06.793
Taqwa (تقوا) can mean, righteousness can mean to us now, a consistent and persevering consciousness

00:54:06.793 --> 00:54:08.623
of Allah, Subhanahu Wa Ta'ala.

00:54:11.047 --> 00:54:18.047
In Sura 91, verses 7 to 10, there is a description of the growth of the soul.

00:54:18.560 --> 00:54:26.259
And it says that the growing soul is the soul that knows the difference between right and wrong.

00:54:26.560 --> 00:54:30.213
The assumption is that the person is following the right.

00:54:30.633 --> 00:54:35.980
In Sura 62, verse 2, the Quran speaks of the functions of messengers.

00:54:36.353 --> 00:54:39.119
Messengers come to help men grow,

00:54:39.119 --> 00:54:41.259
not grow physically,

00:54:41.259 --> 00:54:43.073
to grow spiritually.

00:54:44.573 --> 00:54:49.806
In Sura 2, verse 129, Ibrahim prays to Allah.

00:54:49.806 --> 00:54:52.560
He prays to Allah to send messengers

00:54:52.560 --> 00:54:56.560
to teach Muslims in spiritual and in wisdom,

00:54:56.560 --> 00:54:59.560
and to teach man what man does not know.

00:55:00.000 --> 00:55:10.021
In Sura 2, verse 151, it's clearly shown that growth, growth means growth of the soul.

00:55:10.953 --> 00:55:15.000
It means knowledge of the spiritual, number one.

00:55:15.234 --> 00:55:17.234
It means gaining wisdom,

00:55:17.234 --> 00:55:22.234
or acquiring wisdom from such a knowledge of the spiritual and important,

00:55:22.234 --> 00:55:25.560
coming to know what man did not know before,

00:55:25.560 --> 00:55:28.886
or what man cannot know through his own efforts.

00:55:29.166 --> 00:55:32.814
It is knowledge that can come only through the help of Allah.

00:55:34.213 --> 00:55:40.742
And if we go to Sura 62, verses 2 to 4, and Sura 4, verse 113,

00:55:40.742 --> 00:55:45.840
here we know deeper the meaning of Allah's infinite or boundless grace,

00:55:45.840 --> 00:55:51.560
for it consists precisely in giving mankind these three things.

00:55:51.840 --> 00:55:55.845
And you all know what this is. It refers to the greatest name, Zulfazl Al-Azim (ذُو ٱلْفَضْلِ ٱلْعَظِيمِ).

00:55:56.560 --> 00:56:02.907
Allah is called Zulfazl Al-Azim (ذُو ٱلْفَضْلِ ٱلْعَظِيمِ) because His infinite grace consists precisely in

00:56:02.907 --> 00:56:08.560
teaching us the spiritual, allowing us to have wisdom from following the spiritual.

00:56:08.560 --> 00:56:18.963
In other words, we can say one of the greatest gifts of Allah is precisely giving us the techniques to counteract forgetfulness,

00:56:18.963 --> 00:56:25.886
so that we do not fall into the trap of poor ancestor, Adam.

00:56:26.119 --> 00:56:31.327
Now, it also becomes easier for us to understand what the Quran means when it says,

00:56:31.327 --> 00:56:34.840
that those who forget Allah, forget their souls.

00:56:34.840 --> 00:56:38.886
That is 59, Sura 59:19.

00:56:38.886 --> 00:56:41.560
Do you see how, how beautiful the Quran is?

00:56:41.560 --> 00:56:43.560
It's very consistent.

00:56:43.560 --> 00:56:46.865
Those who forget Allah, forget their souls.

00:56:47.098 --> 00:56:54.513
As I told you earlier, you cannot know Allah unless Allah gives you the power to know Him.

00:56:54.513 --> 00:56:58.980
Allah is so great, no one, nothing can know Allah,

00:56:58.980 --> 00:57:03.886
unless Allah Himself puts something in him or that thing to know Him.

00:57:03.886 --> 00:57:06.327
This is the meaning of knowledge,

00:57:06.327 --> 00:57:09.560
a contact between the Knower and the known,

00:57:09.560 --> 00:57:12.280
and the relation of knowledge.

00:57:12.280 --> 00:57:14.280
Allah had given us the power to know Him.

00:57:15.000 --> 00:57:19.000
But those who insist in rejecting Allah,

00:57:19.000 --> 00:57:24.492
who in effect, even if they say Allah, Allah, Allah, 20,000 times a day,

00:57:24.492 --> 00:57:27.560
if they don't mean it, they forget their souls.

00:57:27.560 --> 00:57:28.560
Why?

00:57:28.560 --> 00:57:31.560
For the soul, as we've mentioned so many times,

00:57:31.560 --> 00:57:33.980
is the most important part of man.

00:57:33.980 --> 00:57:38.933
It is the part the man which represents part of Allah, spirit in him.

00:57:38.933 --> 00:57:42.746
Therefore, to say that Mr. X forgets Allah,

00:57:42.746 --> 00:57:46.026
is the same as saying that Mr. X forgets his soul.

00:57:46.026 --> 00:57:48.119
This is again another tautology.

00:57:48.119 --> 00:57:51.560
It's like saying A is A, or 1+1 is 2.

00:57:52.073 --> 00:57:55.073
In Sura 20:124, it says,

00:57:55.073 --> 00:57:58.560
that he who forgets Allah will be blind in the Last Day.

00:57:59.539 --> 00:58:02.213
And the same Sura 20, verse 136 says,

00:58:02.213 --> 00:58:07.560
that those who forget Allah's revelations will be forgotten by Allah in the Last Day.

00:58:07.560 --> 00:58:11.119
Same thing in Sura 45, verse 34.

00:58:11.119 --> 00:58:12.560
All this means,

00:58:12.560 --> 00:58:16.560
that such individuals will be lost in the Last Day.

00:58:16.560 --> 00:58:17.793
It also means,

00:58:17.793 --> 00:58:20.840
that their souls have shrunk,

00:58:20.840 --> 00:58:24.026
and for all practical purposes, disappeared.

00:58:24.026 --> 00:58:26.560
They are just pure clay.

00:58:26.560 --> 00:58:28.560
It also means,

00:58:28.560 --> 00:58:30.746
that the most essential part...

00:58:50.772 --> 00:58:52.772
... from other forms of clay.

00:58:55.213 --> 00:58:58.497
Before Adam, he forgot.

00:58:59.197 --> 00:59:01.197
But Alhamdu Lillah,

00:59:01.197 --> 00:59:03.049
he was able to remember again.

00:59:05.194 --> 00:59:08.212
He was fast, I suppose so.

00:59:08.212 --> 00:59:10.017
Good for him and for his descendant.

00:59:10.237 --> 00:59:12.788
For when he found that he was abandoned by Shaytan (Satan),

00:59:12.788 --> 00:59:15.060
he immediately turned to Allah.

00:59:16.118 --> 00:59:22.119
And Allah gives him and mankind the instruments to counteract forgetfulness.

00:59:22.119 --> 00:59:23.280
This is up to us.

00:59:23.280 --> 00:59:28.560
Well, I don't know really how fast Adam repented.

00:59:28.560 --> 00:59:32.560
Maybe, I've been (unintelligible) those tasks when he says,

00:59:32.560 --> 00:59:34.767
Repent fast! Did you say last time?

00:59:35.560 --> 00:59:36.814
Did you say, repent fast?

00:59:37.607 --> 00:59:40.187
By the way, with your permission, I would like to tell you a story.

00:59:41.353 --> 00:59:45.560
You know, the Arabs, they are very interesting and wonderful people.

00:59:45.560 --> 00:59:47.560
They have many proverbs and stories.

00:59:47.560 --> 00:59:52.933
They combine Quran with common law, what they call Urs or Adat,

00:59:52.933 --> 00:59:56.560
and tell you stories, but you put, they put them very nicely.

00:59:57.353 --> 00:59:59.373
And there's a story which I don't remember very well.

00:59:59.373 --> 01:00:07.560
They say there are about six things or seven things that a man can do in a hurry.

01:00:08.492 --> 01:00:09.373
I'll put it another way.

01:00:09.373 --> 01:00:13.560
The Arab says, take it easy in everything. Don't hurry,

01:00:13.560 --> 01:00:15.560
except in around six or seven things.

01:00:15.560 --> 01:00:17.560
I don't remember the six or seven things.

01:00:17.560 --> 01:00:19.560
But I read it many years ago.

01:00:20.026 --> 01:00:21.513
But this is what I remember.

01:00:21.513 --> 01:00:29.793
The Arabs say, go slow except when you commit a sin, immediately ask repentance from Allah.

01:00:29.793 --> 01:00:31.301
And you can see, this is Quranic.

01:00:32.467 --> 01:00:35.259
Number two,

01:00:35.259 --> 01:00:37.166
when your guests come to your house,

01:00:37.166 --> 01:00:39.560
and they are hungry, immediately feed them.

01:00:39.560 --> 01:00:41.560
Don't take it easy.

01:00:41.560 --> 01:00:43.539
This is Arab. This is Arab hospitality.

01:00:44.560 --> 01:00:51.793
The third one is, if you owe a person's money, please pay your debts.

01:00:51.793 --> 01:00:53.001
This is common sense.

01:00:54.213 --> 01:00:57.420
Before the (unintelligible), when a man dies,

01:00:57.420 --> 01:01:00.280
hurry up to this barrier before he stinks.

01:01:02.005 --> 01:01:05.119
And one of them, I think the last one, I forgot, is

01:01:05.119 --> 01:01:07.560
if you have a young pretty virgin daughter,

01:01:07.560 --> 01:01:09.560
marry her fast, don't wait,

01:01:09.560 --> 01:01:13.861
before the value of the price, the Mahr, goes down.

01:01:15.586 --> 01:01:20.933
But anyhow, to go back to, to go back to the Khutba,

01:01:20.933 --> 01:01:26.560
here we can see that the Fãtehah really summarizes very well everything that we have said,

01:01:26.560 --> 01:01:30.000
that Allah is the Lord of the worlds,

01:01:30.000 --> 01:01:32.001
the Creator therefore of mankind,

01:01:32.001 --> 01:01:35.421
but the Master of the Day of Judgment.

01:01:36.234 --> 01:01:37.975
We need His help and guidance.

01:01:39.560 --> 01:01:42.560
And we pray to Him for it.

01:01:42.560 --> 01:01:46.560
In other words, we assume, we accept from Him that we need His help,

01:01:46.560 --> 01:01:49.394
and therefore we want His revelation.

01:01:50.560 --> 01:01:54.530
And we pray to Him that we should not be among the disbelievers and hypocrites.

01:01:57.280 --> 01:01:58.767
They have forgotten Allah.

01:01:59.047 --> 01:02:03.026
Even if they say Allah, Allah, Allah,

01:02:03.026 --> 01:02:07.404
disbelievers and the hypocrites, for all practical purposes,

01:02:07.404 --> 01:02:12.907
are saying with their mouths what their hearts denies.

01:02:13.280 --> 01:02:16.560
They do not fear Him. They do not fear Allah.

01:02:16.560 --> 01:02:19.001
They do not accept Him as Lord.

01:02:19.001 --> 01:02:22.628
They do not accept Him as Judge.

01:02:23.560 --> 01:02:30.000
And we pray to Allah that He help us remember Him.

01:02:31.166 --> 01:02:33.280
And there's a very beautiful verse in Quran,

01:02:33.280 --> 01:02:35.119
I don't know what's the number.

01:02:35.119 --> 01:02:36.119
Allah says,

01:02:36.119 --> 01:02:37.174
[2:152]  ... remember Me, ...

01:02:37.174 --> 01:02:38.560
and I will remember you.

01:02:38.560 --> 01:02:41.073
[2:152]  ... be thankful unto Me; ...

01:02:41.073 --> 01:02:44.726
and do not belong to those who deny, to the disbelievers.

01:02:45.000 --> 01:02:47.923
(2:152) فَٱذْكُرُونِىٓ أَذْكُرْكُمْ وَٱشْكُرُوا لِى وَلَا تَكْفُرُونِ

01:02:51.047 --> 01:02:53.047
A'uzu Billahi Mina Shaytani Rajim

01:02:53.374 --> 01:02:54.882
Bism Allah Arrahman Arraheem

01:02:56.560 --> 01:03:03.480
اللهم اغفر لِلْمُؤْمِنِينَ والمؤمنات والمسلمين والمسلمات الاحياء منهم والاموات

01:03:04.010 --> 01:03:09.082
رَبَّنَآ ءَاتِنَا فِى ٱلدُّنْيَا حَسَنَةً وَفِى ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ حَسَنَةً وَقِنَا عَذَابَ ٱلنَّارِ (2:201)

01:03:09.765 --> 01:03:13.884
